                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "20235525-0da3-360c-8d9b-105b6f1cb520",
                        "entry_id": "c8cba905-ec5c-3390-b9ff-070ae38da177",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The basic unit of money in China."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "34e9616c-bf0e-4375-af62-1efe6fa4d318",
                                "sense_id": "20235525-0da3-360c-8d9b-105b6f1cb520",
                                "text": "Sung paused to show me some of the notes. They were in issues of five yuan (a Chinese dollar, equal at this time to a little less than one American dollar), one yuan, twenty and ten cent denominations."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fa0293e6-bf06-4299-84b6-59642cf36fda",
                                "sense_id": "20235525-0da3-360c-8d9b-105b6f1cb520",
                                "text": "The Nanchiaoshan Co-operative in Kuangling County originally had 14 households. But they became dissatisfied and 7 withdrew because nothing was done when the production-team leader (a rich peasant) and the bookkeeper made away with some 60 yuan of public money.",
                                "translation": "中国农村的社会主义高潮（选本）",
                                "english": "中国农村的社会主义高潮（选本）"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "55a3b0f5-2b0c-4ebd-9bed-842b2cc547c6",
                                "sense_id": "20235525-0da3-360c-8d9b-105b6f1cb520",
                                "text": "A ticket to these Saturday and Sunday night dances costs 15 yuan, or $5.35, which is a lot when one considers that the average Peking worker makes 60 to 70 yuan ($21 to $25) a month."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "90673934-a4a8-4367-a48e-43368c66c127",
                                "sense_id": "20235525-0da3-360c-8d9b-105b6f1cb520",
                                "text": "Donations to the mosque come from a village considered fairly poor by regional standards, with an average annual income of 300 yuan (about U.S. $100) per household. The 1982 average per capita annual income in Yongning County was substantially higher, 539 yuan according to the Population Census Office (1987:206)."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "928b6ca5-ec77-45b0-95b6-995de9149b3f",
                                "sense_id": "20235525-0da3-360c-8d9b-105b6f1cb520",
                                "text": "The provincial government has designated thirty-four counties in Henan as officially impoverished (pinkun xian) according to the provincial criterion: an average annual per capita income below 500 yuan and total household assets valued at less than 8,000 yuan, based on 1990 prices."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "679ae80d-d6ba-4797-ba5e-ff5fea9f71b0",
                                "sense_id": "20235525-0da3-360c-8d9b-105b6f1cb520",
                                "text": "In Pinggu, a suburb of Beijing, residents were told that they would receive 50-yuan ($7.60) prizes in cash or merchandise once they had been fully vaccinated."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0b35e245-ad28-4b9a-9fd8-2a63cbacbf05",
                                "sense_id": "20235525-0da3-360c-8d9b-105b6f1cb520",
                                "text": "The popular Chinese coffee chain rolled out the so-called “sauce-flavored latte” with a jolt of liquor for 38 yuan ($5.20) on Monday. Customers who order with an online coupon will be able to receive 50% off for a limited time, it said."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ad792093-7dda-45fa-a168-1795247746a2",
                                "sense_id": "20235525-0da3-360c-8d9b-105b6f1cb520",
                                "text": "The drink is priced at 68 yuan ($9.45), according to the app."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
